# Secrets — these exist on disk with real values and must NEVER enter the image.
**/.env*
**/.devnet
**/*-escrow.json
**/*-feepayer.json
**/*-platform-fee.json
**/*-stake-treasury.json
**/*keypair*.json

# Bulk that the backend never reads at runtime (IDLs are vendored into apps/backend/src).
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
monorepo/anchor
monorepo/apps/mobile
!monorepo/apps/mobile/
monorepo/apps/mobile/*
!monorepo/apps/mobile/package.json
monorepo/brand
monorepo/design-reference
monorepo/docs
*.pdf
*.md
